      ],
      "source": "https://www.canadacreekranch.com/About_Us/History",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Spanning roughly 21 square miles—about 13,500 acres—the property offers a vast natural landscape for residents and guests.",
